<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: vivi advanced apparels -->
  <VV_AdvancedApparels.label>薇薇进阶服饰</VV_AdvancedApparels.label>
  <!-- EN: Make advanced clothing for the Vivis. -->
  <VV_AdvancedApparels.description>制作薇薇的进阶服饰。</VV_AdvancedApparels.description>
  <!-- EN: advanced gathering -->
  <VV_AdvancedGathering.label>进阶收集</VV_AdvancedGathering.label>
  <!-- EN: Can gather propolis from trees and process it into neutroamine and herbal medicine. Some living leaves can also be gathered from certain arcane plants. -->
  <VV_AdvancedGathering.description>能从树木中提取与加工蜂胶。</VV_AdvancedGathering.description>
  <!-- EN: vivi apparels -->
  <VV_Apparels.label>薇薇服饰</VV_Apparels.label>
  <!-- EN: Make basic clothing for the Vivis. -->
  <VV_Apparels.description>制作薇薇的基础服饰。</VV_Apparels.description>
  <!-- EN: arcane botany -->
  <VV_ArcaneBotany.label>奥秘植物学</VV_ArcaneBotany.label>
  <!-- EN: Can visually display the flow of environment mana emitted by arcane plants. Can make items using arcane plant materials and build facilities that aid cultivation. -->
  <VV_ArcaneBotany.description>直观显示神秘植物的环境魔能流向。允许使用神秘植物材料制作物品，建造有助于耕种的设施。</VV_ArcaneBotany.description>
  <!-- EN: You can now visualize the flow of environment mana. Select an arcane plant or enable the environment mana grid from the bottom-right toggle bar. -->
  <VV_ArcaneBotany.discoveredLetterText>现在，你可以可视化环境魔能的流动。选择一种奥术植物或在右下角启用环境魔能网格。</VV_ArcaneBotany.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: Env. Mana grid -->
  <VV_ArcaneBotany.discoveredLetterTitle>环境魔能网络</VV_ArcaneBotany.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: arcane plant sowing -->
  <VV_ArcanePlantSowing.label>神秘植物播种</VV_ArcanePlantSowing.label>
  <!-- EN: Grow arcane plants by planting arcane seeds. Arcane seeds can be found by chance while foraging or purchased from vivi caravans.\n\nDeconstructing an arcane plant also yields multiple seeds along with materials. When planted in suitable soil or a pot, an arcane seed grows into a seedling. To mature into a full arcane plant it requires both nutrients and mana.\n\nNutrients must be regularly supplied using mana fertilizer. If left depleted for too long, the seedling will die.\n\nMana is naturally absorbed from the environment, so placing the seedling near arcane plants that emit environment mana or building a Mana emitter can help provide it. -->
  <VV_ArcanePlantSowing.description>神秘植物需要通过种植神秘种子获得。神秘种子可以在采集时偶然获得，也可以从薇薇商队购买。\n\n构建一种神秘植物也会产出一些种子和材料。当种植在合适的土壤或栽培盆中时，神秘种子会长成幼苗。要长成一株完全神秘的植物，幼苗需要营养和魔能。\n\n必须使用魔法肥料定期供应营养。如果幼苗长时间处于营养耗尽状态会导致其死亡。\n\n神秘植物所需的魔能可以从环境中自然吸收，因此将幼苗放在能释放环境魔能的神秘植物附近或建造一个魔能放射器以供给之。</VV_ArcanePlantSowing.description>
  <!-- EN: Arcane seeds can be found by chance while foraging or purchased from vivi caravans. Deconstructing an arcane plant also yields multiple seeds along with materials.\n\nWhen planted in suitable soil or a pot, an arcane seed grows into a seedling. To mature into a full arcane plant it requires both nutrients and mana.\n\nNutrients must be regularly supplied using mana fertilizer. If left depleted for too long, the seedling will die.\n\nMana is naturally absorbed from the environment, so placing the seedling near arcane plants that emit environment mana or building a Mana emitter can help provide it. -->
  <VV_ArcanePlantSowing.discoveredLetterText>神秘种子可以在采集时偶然获得，也可以从薇薇商队购买。\n\n构建一种神秘植物也会产出一些种子和材料。当种植在合适的土壤或栽培盆中时，神秘种子会长成幼苗。要长成一株完全神秘的植物，幼苗需要营养和魔能。\n\n必须使用魔法肥料定期供应营养。如果幼苗长时间处于营养耗尽状态会导致其死亡。\n\n神秘植物所需的魔能可以从环境中自然吸收，因此将幼苗放在能释放环境魔能的神秘植物附近或建造一个魔能放射器以供给之。</VV_ArcanePlantSowing.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: Arcane plant -->
  <VV_ArcanePlantSowing.discoveredLetterTitle>神秘植物</VV_ArcanePlantSowing.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: basic gathering -->
  <VV_BasicGathering.label>基础收集</VV_BasicGathering.label>
  <!-- EN: Build facilities for collecting and processing honey and pollen, the staple foods of the vivis. -->
  <VV_BasicGathering.description>建造收集和加工蜂蜜和花粉的设施，那是薇薇们的主食。</VV_BasicGathering.description>
  <!-- EN: vivi basic infrastructures -->
  <VV_BasicInfra.label>薇薇基础设施</VV_BasicInfra.label>
  <!-- EN: Build basic production facilities and structures for the Vivis. -->
  <VV_BasicInfra.description>建造薇薇们基本的生产设施与建筑结构。</VV_BasicInfra.description>
  <!-- EN: gathering tools -->
  <VV_Tools.label>收集用工具</VV_Tools.label>
  <!-- EN: Make tools that enhance gathering ability. The gathering tool can be worn at the waist when not in use. -->
  <VV_Tools.description>制作薇薇们用于采集的工具，只能被薇薇装备，使用腰部装备槽。</VV_Tools.description>
  <!-- EN: vivi weaponry -->
  <VV_Weaponry.label>薇薇武器</VV_Weaponry.label>
  <!-- EN: Make traditional weapons used by the Vivis. These weapons can only be used by vivis. -->
  <VV_Weaponry.description>制作薇薇们使用的传统武器，只能被薇薇使用。</VV_Weaponry.description>
</LanguageData>